{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;\u5263\u6483\u30af\u30ed\u30b9\u30be\u30fc\u30f3&quot;\u00a0 (KenGeki CrossZone)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original 2D fighting game produced by &quot;Kosei Dojo&quot;, which believes in an aggressive stance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate your character to attack and eliminate your opponent's life to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong attack! There are many offsets! The more buttons you press, the better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy operation with special move button! (The conventional command method can also be used at the same time)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently 5 characters are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game mode \u201cVS CPU\u201d \u201cVS PLAYER\u201d \u201cTRAINING\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Not compatible with online/local matches only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently being distributed in early access version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to distribute correction patches such as character additions for free until the final version on the official website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445430?t=1771346907","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445430?t=1771346907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445430/6f45558b72ab61da889ce779f0dda50375acd040/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771346907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445430/6f45558b72ab61da889ce779f0dda50375acd040/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771346907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id"